## Why This Is Asked
This question assesses practical Android offline-first skills with Room, WorkManager, Retrofit, and notifications, plus how to design a robust data flow for low network conditions.

## Key Concepts
- Room entities and DAOs
- Retrofit REST API
- WorkManager with network and charging constraints
- Local notifications and TTL-based staleness

